---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Songstarter from '../../components/tools/Songstarter.jsx';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Songstarter — random song starting points"
  description="A random scene, line, or image every click. Free tool by The Songwriter's Desk."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="serif text-4xl mb-3">Songstarter</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-soft text-lg mb-8">
      A scene, a line, a collision of images. Random every click. Sit with it —
      or hit it again and see what comes next.
    </p>

    <Songstarter client:load />

    <section class="prose mt-14">
      <h2>How to use this</h2>

      <p>
        A blank page isn't really blank — it's crowded with all the songs you
        could write. What you usually need isn't inspiration, it's
        <em>restriction</em>. A specific image, narrow enough to step into.
      </p>

      <h3>Don't take the first one</h3>
      <p>
        The first line is almost never the one. Hit <em>Another one</em> three
        or four times. The one that lands tends to be the one you didn't
        expect.
      </p>

      <h3>Treat it as a room, not an instruction</h3>
      <p>
        The starter isn't what your song is about — it's where your song
        <em>starts</em>. Write into it. Leave it. Come back to it. The song
        might end up a mile away from the starter by the second verse. Good.
      </p>

      <h3>Let it be weird</h3>
      <p>
        Some of these are concrete scenes. Some are surreal images that won't
        immediately make sense. Both are useful. The mind, given a
        juxtaposition it didn't ask for, tends to do more interesting work
        than the mind told to "write about heartbreak."
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="mt-14 p-6 rounded-lg border border-ink/10 bg-paper-warm">
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted mb-2">Related tools</div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href="/tools/slant-rhymes" class="hover:text-accent">Slant rhyme finder</a>
        <span class="text-ink-muted">·</span>
        <a href="/tools/song-title-generator" class="hover:text-accent">Song title generator</a>
        <span class="text-ink-muted">·</span>
        <a href="/tools/song-structure" class="hover:text-accent">Song structure builder</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
